@richdayandnight Hm, good question. Not an official way, and it won’t automatically update as you add cells, but you could do: 

document.querySelectorAll("body &gt; div &gt; .observablehq").length

(Why do you ask? Would you like better ways to see that kind of thing?) https://t.co/yQtmnvlKEe

@richdayandnight @utopiah We will look into that!  
What I usually do is click on the top left Observable logo, which takes me to my home page in one click, but then you still have to click on notebooks in the left menu.  
Definitely worth thinking about a single click to your notebooks.  Thanks!

@duto_guerra Thanks for letting us know John! We're digging in to the issue and have partially isolated the cause.

