@lepinekong Unlike a let, though, you can’t assign the value of a cell from another cell. If you just want to paste code in, you can wrap the cell with curly braces to make a block.

{
  let foo = 1;
  let bar = 2;
}

@aaronshaf Option (or Alt) -Delete will do it.

As will Shift-click on the collapse button between cells.

For the full list of key shortcuts, type “?”
